            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Post 0.2.9

- Original email formatting is preserved by default, including sender fonts, signatures, body colors and image dimensions.
- Reading settings offer independent custom font and app-color overrides.
- Shift+Arrow selection releases list focus to prevent macOS error sounds.
- Automatic sorting learns consistent sender destinations even when newsletter subjects change.
- Includes the recent label menu, Sent recipient display, All Mail, and newsletter loading fixes.
]]></description>
